      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[Agent view: the terminal shows the session's colors, the CLI's own input box no longer duplicates the reply box, and you can paste images into the reply boxes. Agent sessions in the sidebar keep their order instead of jumping around.]]></description>
